---
const topics = [
  'MPASI Sehat & Tumbuh Kembang',
  'Panduan MPASI Sesuai Usia',
  'Ide Menu MPASI 4 Bintang',
  'Nutrisi & Kebutuhan Bayi',
  'Tips Memilih Bahan Makanan',
  'Resep MPASI Praktis',
  'Tips Menghadapi GTM',
  'Penyimpanan & Food Prep',
];
---

<footer class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 pt-16 pb-12 rounded-t-[3rem] mt-20 relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <!-- Subtle Gradient Accent Top -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-orange via-brand-blue to-brand-green"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Top Section: CTA Card Banner inside Footer -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-orange to-amber-600 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 mb-16 text-white shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="space-y-2 text-center md:text-left">
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
          Nutrisi Terbaik Bayi Anda
        </span>
        <h3 class="font-bubblegum text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold">
          Ingin Si Kecil Lahap & Tumbuh Optimal?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-white/90 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-xl">
          Dapatkan paket menu MPASI sehat siap saji atau ikuti panduan resep praktis kami setiap hari.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a
          href="/#produk"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-brand-orange bg-white hover:bg-orange-50 transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg hover:scale-105 text-base sm:text-lg whitespace-nowrap"
        >
          Pilih makanan sehat untuk si kecil
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-orange" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Footer Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 pb-12 border-b border-slate-800">
      
      <!-- Brand & Description -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-4">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-brand-orange" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="28" fill="#fff7ed"/>
              <path d="M16 32C16 41.94 23.16 50 32 50C40.84 50 48 41.94 48 32H16Z" fill="#f76806"/>
              <path d="M20 32C20 28 25 26 32 26C39 26 44 28 44 32H20Z" fill="#0b6623"/>
              <path d="M42 16L32 29" stroke="#0041c2" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <ellipse cx="45" cy="14" rx="5" ry="3" transform="rotate(-30 45 14)" fill="#0041c2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="font-bubblegum text-2xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-wide block leading-none">
              Nutri<span class="text-brand-orange">Bayi</span>
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-green tracking-wider uppercase block mt-1">
              Digital Media & MPASI Sehat
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Platform digital dan penyedia produk MPASI sehat, praktis, bergizi, dan aman untuk bayi usia 6–24 bulan. Menemani setiap langkah orang tua muda menghadirkan makanan penuh cinta tanpa drama GTM.
        </p>

        <!-- Social Icons -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-2">
          <a
            href="https://instagram.com"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="Instagram NutriBayi"
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-slate-800 hover:bg-brand-orange text-white flex items-center justify-center transition-colors"
          >
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zm0-2.163c-3.259 0-3.667.014-4.947.072-4.358.2-6.78 2.618-6.98 6.98-.059 1.281-.073 1.689-.073 4.948 0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98 1.281.058 1.689.072 4.948.072 3.259 0 3.668-.014 4.948-.072 4.354-.2 6.782-2.618 6.979-6.98.059-1.28.073-1.689.073-4.948 0-3.259-.014-3.667-.072-4.947-.196-4.354-2.617-6.78-6.979-6.98-1.281-.059-1.69-.073-4.949-.073zm0 5.838c-3.403 0-6.162 2.759-6.162 6.162s2.759 6.163 6.162 6.163 6.162-2.759 6.162-6.163c0-3.403-2.759-6.162-6.162-6.162zm0 10.162c-2.209 0-4-1.79-4-4 0-2.209 1.791-4 4-4s4 1.791 4 4c0 2.21-1.791 4-4 4zm6.406-11.845c-.796 0-1.441.645-1.441 1.44s.645 1.44 1.441 1.44c.795 0 1.439-.645 1.439-1.44s-.644-1.44-1.439-1.44z"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://tiktok.com"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="TikTok NutriBayi"
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-slate-800 hover:bg-brand-blue text-white flex items-center justify-center transition-colors"
          >
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M19.59 6.69a4.83 4.83 0 0 1-3.77-4.25V2h-3.45v13.67a2.89 2.89 0 0 1-5.2 1.74 2.89 2.89 0 0 1 2.31-4.64c.298-.002.595.042.88.13V9.4a6.33 6.33 0 0 0-1-.08A6.34 6.34 0 0 0 3 15.66a6.34 6.34 0 0 0 10.86 4.43c.48-.48.87-1.05 1.14-1.68V11.2a8.16 8.16 0 0 0 4.59 1.4v-3.45a4.85 4.85 0 0 1-2.9-2.46z"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/6281234567890"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="WhatsApp Konsultasi MPASI"
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-slate-800 hover:bg-brand-green text-white flex items-center justify-center transition-colors"
          >
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.587-5.946.003-6.556 5.338-11.891 11.893-11.891 3.181.001 6.167 1.24 8.413 3.488 2.245 2.248 3.481 5.236 3.48 8.414-.003 6.557-5.338 11.892-11.893 11.892-1.99-.001-3.951-.5-5.688-1.448l-6.305 1.654zm6.597-3.807c1.676.995 3.276 1.591 5.392 1.592 5.448 0 9.886-4.434 9.889-9.885.002-5.462-4.415-9.89-9.881-9.892-5.452 0-9.887 4.434-9.889 9.884-.001 2.225.651 3.891 1.746 5.634l-.999 3.648 3.742-.981zm11.387-5.464c-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347-.297-.149-1.758-.868-2.031-.967-.272-.099-.47-.149-.669.149-.198.297-.768.967-.941 1.165-.173.198-.347.223-.644.074-.297-.149-1.255-.462-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.297-.347.446-.521.151-.172.2-.296.3-.495.099-.198.05-.372-.025-.521-.075-.148-.669-1.611-.916-2.206-.242-.579-.487-.501-.669-.51l-.57-.01c-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372s-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 1.065 2.876 1.213 3.074c.149.198 2.095 3.2 5.076 4.487.709.306 1.263.489 1.694.626.712.226 1.36.194 1.872.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.695.248-1.29.173-1.414z"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Links -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 sm:col-span-1 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="font-bubblegum text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-wide">
          Navigasi
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors">Beranda</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#produk" class="hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors">Produk MPASI</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog" class="hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors">Semua Artikel</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors">Tentang Kami</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#faq" class="hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors">Tanya Jawab (FAQ)</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Topik Blog MPASI -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 sm:col-span-1 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="font-bubblegum text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-wide">
          Topik MPASI Terfavorit
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
          {topics.slice(0, 5).map((topic) => (
            <li>
              <a href={`/blog?tag=${encodeURIComponent(topic)}`} class="hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors block truncate">
                {topic}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Kontak & Info Layanan -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="font-bubblegum text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-wide">
          Bantuan & Konsultasi
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Punya pertanyaan seputar MPASI atau pesanan menu si kecil? Tim kami siap membantu Bunda setiap hari.
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-brand-orange font-bold">WhatsApp:</span>
            <span>+62 812-3456-7890</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-brand-orange font-bold">Email:</span>
            <span>halo@nutribayi.com</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-brand-orange font-bold">Jam Kerja:</span>
            <span>Senin - Sabtu: 08.00 - 18.00 WIB</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Disclaimer & Copyright -->
    <div class="pt-8 text-center sm:text-left flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
      <p class="max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Disclaimer Medis:</strong> Seluruh artikel, panduan, dan resep di situs NutriBayi ditujukan untuk edukasi umum dan tidak menggantikan anjuran medis langsung dari Dokter Spesialis Anak (Sp.A).
      </p>
      <p class="whitespace-nowrap">
        &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} NutriBayi. Seluruh hak cipta dilindungi.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
